<div class="container mx-auto prose-xl">
    {{> 'partials/title_heading' title="Watch Our Congress! Help Keep Them Clean and Accountable!" }}


    <p>
        Congress travels a lot to support various initiatives and be informated on topics.
        We the people must watch and understand what these initiatives are and why they are traveling.
    </p>
    <p>
        Inform yourself below with filters on where they are traveling and who is sponsoring it.
    </p>

</div>

<hr />

<div class="container mx-auto mt-12 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
    <div class="md:col-span-3 prose-xl">
        <h2>Explore Congressional Hearings</h2>
        <p>
            Stay informed about the discussions and witness testimonies that shape our legislative landscape. 
            We have indexed <strong>{{ TotalHearings }}</strong> hearings held between <strong>{{ OldestHearing }}</strong> and <strong>{{ LatestHearing }}</strong> 
            across all House and Senate committees.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our platform provides you with direct access to full transcripts and official records, allowing you to 
            search and analyze the conversations that matter most in the 119th Congress and beyond.
        </p>
        <p>
            <a href="/hearings" class="btn no-underline">View All Hearings</a>
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-1 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 h-fit">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 mt-0">Daily Sync Activity</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm list-none p-0 m-0">
            {{#each JobSummaries}}
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 last:border-0 last:pb-0">
                {{#if this.HasFailures}}
                <span class="w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-600 dark:bg-red-500 shrink-0"></span>
                {{else}}
                <span class="w-2 h-2 mt-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-500 shrink-0"></span>
                {{/if}}
                <div class="leading-tight">
                    <span class="font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 block text-xs">{{ this.DisplayDate }}</span>
                    <span class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs">{{ this.Message }}</span>
                </div>
            </li>
            {{/each}}
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container mx-auto prose-xl mt-12">
    <hr />
    <h2>Find out about recent gifted travel</h2>
    {{> 'htmx/travel_gauge_cluster' GaugeStats }}
    <p>
        Find out about the most recent travel that has been gifted to our congress members. This is a great way to see
        who is
        influencing our congress members and how they are being influenced.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="col-span-1">
            {{> 'htmx/top_destinations' TopDestinations=TopDestinations }}
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-3">
             <div class="overflow-auto">
                <blockquote class="text-sm italic text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">
                    <p>
                        In accordance with House Rule 25, Members, officers, and staff must file reports
                        detailing travel-related expenses reimbursed by non-government sources. Section 304 of the 
                        Honest Leadership and Open Government Act of 2007 requires these reports to be public.
                    </p>
                </blockquote>
                {{> 'htmx/travel_list' GiftTravel=RecentTravel }}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container mx-auto prose-xl mt-12 border-2 border-red-500 p-6 rounded-lg">
    <h2 class="text-red-700">Service Update: Law & Bill Tracking</h2>
    <p>
        The <strong>LAW</strong> and <strong>BILL</strong> tracking modules (including bill text, sponsorship lists, and topic tags) are currently disabled for maintenance and database upgrades. 
    </p>
    <p>
        Hearing records and Gifted Travel data remain fully operational. We apologize for the inconvenience.
    </p>
</div>


